{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029780/extras/7846239ba7d6459f36adea626efcdfea.poster.avif?t=1761580738\" width=1144 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029780/extras/7846239ba7d6459f36adea626efcdfea.webm?t=1761580738\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by a true story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the demo of Fractured Blooms. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the first slice of Angie\u2019s story, a teenage girl who finds herself trapped in a soft and unchanging world. As the days repeat, small shifts begin to surface. Only by mastering your routine will you uncover the truth. Tread carefully, however, this world is not as it seems, and there\u2019s something darker beneath the soil. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is it that you\u2019re really trying to keep alive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Learn the basics of:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf31 Gardening - Plant, water, and harvest crops to sustain yourself.</strong>  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029780/extras/9eb1963108d16d6f95144ffa6b018f86.poster.avif?t=1761580738\" width=1144 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029780/extras/9eb1963108d16d6f95144ffa6b018f86.webm?t=1761580738\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029780/extras/9eb1963108d16d6f95144ffa6b018f86.mp4?t=1761580738\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf73 Cooking - Prepare meals from what you\u2019ve grown and rediscover forgotten recipes.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029780/extras/fe55aec7b75e31897cfb83911d45eb91.poster.avif?t=1761580738\" width=1144 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029780/extras/fe55aec7b75e31897cfb83911d45eb91.webm?t=1761580738\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029780/extras/fe55aec7b75e31897cfb83911d45eb91.mp4?t=1761580738\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfe0 Daily Rituals - Keep your home tidy, care for its spaces, and find comfort in simple repetition.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029780/extras/66d43471a6625c6e4c32c8ed5afd33f3.poster.avif?t=1761580738\" width=1144 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029780/extras/66d43471a6625c6e4c32c8ed5afd33f3.webm?t=1761580738\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029780/extras/66d43471a6625c6e4c32c8ed5afd33f3.mp4?t=1761580738\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo focuses on introducing the core gameplay loop and emotional tone, a first step into the world of Fractured Blooms. It\u2019s our way of sharing a small piece of something deeply personal, a blend of warmth and quiet horror. Thank you for letting us show you something so intimate. Our story is now in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img clas